nshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006","quote":"謝孺子","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0099"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"恂子，善笙、西陽太守。《宋書》52作稚，梁50傳徵祖稚也任宋司徒主簿。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"684_eaa_511_A","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-ruzi-xun-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006","quote":"恂子孺子，少與族兄莊齊名。多藝能，尤善聲律。車騎將軍王彧，孺子姑之子也。嘗與孺子宴桐臺，孺子吹笙，彧自起舞，旣而歎曰：「今日眞使人飄颻有伊、洛間意。」爲新安王主簿，出爲廬江郡，辭，宋孝武謂有司曰：「謝孺子不可屈爲小郡。」乃以爲司徒主簿。後以家貧，求西陽太守，卒官。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0000","source_term":"恂子孺子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"本句並書父與子。《宋書》同人作「恂子稚」。"}},{"id":"684_eaa_511_AAA","label":"謝璟","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"璟","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0026"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"璟","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"璟","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0026"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"孺子子，微父；《梁書》50徵傳具名父璟，其從叔朓與開西邸、入侍、辭年老求金紫等兩書同事。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"684_eaa_511_AA","source_assertio